  "id": "warmth",
  "term": "warmth",
  "definition": "In this packet, warmth refers to parental emotional warmth: a parenting style marked by affectionate acceptance and supportive behavior toward a child. It is contrasted with rejecting or overprotective parenting and is described as generally beneficial for children’s psychological and social development.",
